
## 🛠️ Tech Stack
- **IaC**: Terraform v1.9+
- **Cloud**: AWS (us-west-2)
- **Compute**: EC2 t3.micro, Amazon Linux 2023
- **Networking**: Custom VPC, 4 Subnets, IGW, Route Tables, NAT-less design
- **Security**: Security Groups with port 80 ingress, DB port 3306 locked to web tier
- **Load Balancing**: Application Load Balancer, Target Groups
- **Automation**: User data scripts for Apache install

## 📁 Files
| File | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| `providers.tf` | AWS provider + region config |
| `vpc.tf` | VPC, subnets, IGW, route tables — Multi-AZ setup |
| `security.tf` | Web SG + DB SG with least-privilege rules |
| `ec2.tf` | 2x EC2 instances with Apache via user_data |
| `alb.tf` | Application Load Balancer + target groups |
| `outputs.tf` | Outputs ALB DNS name for browser testing |

